cess / Paraneoplastic Endocrine Syndrome", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "expanded", "prior": 0.3938730853391685, "posterior": 0.2311463927153864, "danger": 0.8, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.5, "evidence_for": ["Multisystem involvement and subacute progression provide weak support for paraneoplastic endocrine syndrome (B1) but do not strongly override other hyperglycem…"], "evidence_against": ["The subacute timeline weakly argues against paraneoplastic syndrome (B1) but provides weak support for metabolic decompensation (B2/B3)."], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": ["B1.1", "B1.2", "B1.3"], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 1.5, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.6, "interrupt_relevance": 0.9, "level_role": "family", "classification_axis": "mechanism", "representative_diseases": []}, "B2": {"id": "B2", "label": "Diabetic Hyperglycemia (Insulin Deficiency from Beta-Cell Destruction)", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "live", "prior": 0.3544857768052517, "posterior": 0.34041559654447817, "danger": 0.5, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.0, "evidence_for": ["Severe hyperglycemia moderately supports beta-cell destruction over insulin resistance as the primary mechanism."], "evidence_against": ["Obesity and smoking moderately support insulin resistance as the primary mechanism over beta-cell destruction."], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": [], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 1.2, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.4, "interrupt_relevance": 0.3, "level_role": "family", "classification_axis": "mechanism", "representative_diseases": []}, "B3": {"id": "B3", "label": "Insulin Resistance with Hyperglycemia", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "live", "prior": 0.19693654266958424, "posterior": 0.1891197758580434, "danger": 0.2, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.0, "evidence_for": ["Obesity and smoking moderately support 